## What I built
A faithful SwiftUI parity of `features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/QuickStatsGrid.tsx`, modeled on the canonical `QuickMetrics`/`SummaryStatsGrid` siblings, split into 9 files (all `QuickStatsGrid.*`, the only allowed scope):

